// A rod with a helical V groove ground by a V-rimmed wheel carried along a screw.
//
// Refused: Aetheris has no sweep of a solid and no general subtraction, and this sweep's wall is
// an envelope: the wheel leans to the screw's axis, so its groove's flanks are none of the wheel's
// own cones. Its Thread cuts only the metric 60° profile, about the axis, not by a leaning wheel.
